1
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:33,799
Sunday roast and Sunday pride,

2
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:38,899
My schoolboy right by my side.

3
00:00:48,799 --> 00:00:53,000
I raised a king from honest bread,

4
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:58,000
With golden dreams inside his head.

5
00:00:58,399 --> 00:01:02,799
A goldfish swimming in the mud,

6
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,400
A broken branch from tainted blood!

7
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:11,799
She won't pull down what I have built,

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:17,400
I’ll wash away her street-born guilt!

9
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:22,000
No father's hand to hold the reins,

10
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:26,900
A flat behind the railway trains.

11
00:01:27,099 --> 00:01:31,500
A shop-girl wrapping blooms for pay,

12
00:01:31,900 --> 00:01:36,500
Who’ll lead my dreamy boy astray.

13
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,500
A goldfish dropped into the dirt,

14
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:46,200
She’ll leave my green boy cold and hurt!

15
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:51,000
No broken home shall cross this floor,

16
00:01:51,299 --> 00:01:57,000
I lock the latch and bar the door!

17
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:09,599
My knife scrapes sharp against the plate,

18
00:02:09,699 --> 00:02:15,500
I crush the ember, seal her fate.

19
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:20,500
Blue smoke curling in the air,

20
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:25,599
She’s just a trap, a wicked snare.

21
00:02:25,699 --> 00:02:30,199
A goldfish stripped of all her grace,

22
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:35,000
Erased without a single trace!

23
00:02:35,199 --> 00:02:39,800
Beyond the parket she won't go,

24
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,800
I rule this house, I say NO!

25
00:03:11,199 --> 00:03:15,599
I crush my match into the ash,

26
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:20,400
Her golden illusion turns to trash.

27
00:03:20,599 --> 00:03:25,500
Keep her outside! Lock the gate!

28
00:03:25,699 --> 00:03:34,000
My roof, my rules, my son, his fate!